{"id":"5408daacba221251","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-3sat.md","title":"3SAT","display":"df-3sat — 3SAT","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"df-3sat — 3SAT","label":"28-df-3sat","aliases":["28-df-3sat"],"type":"definition","depends_on":["[[28-df-cnf]]","[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]","[[28-df-sat]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"df-3sat — 3SAT"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-3sat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-3sat</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" href=\"?note=c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" title=\"28-df-cnf\">28-df-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4041cfa2975b8dd1\" href=\"?note=4041cfa2975b8dd1\" title=\"28-df-sat\">28-df-sat</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{CNF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropVar}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" href=\"?note=c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" title=\"28-df-cnf\">28-df-cnf</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}:\\mathrm{CNF}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}:\\mathrm{CNF}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4041cfa2975b8dd1\" href=\"?note=4041cfa2975b8dd1\" title=\"28-df-sat\">28-df-sat</a> 中已逐字段定义的规范编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{3SAT}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}(\\Phi)\\mid\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\Phi\\;|C|\\le3\\land\n\\exists\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{CNFEval}_{\\alpha}(\\Phi)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{3SAT}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}(\\Phi)\\mid\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\Phi\\;|C|\\le3\\land\n\\exists\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{CNFEval}_{\\alpha}(\\Phi)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>与原书一致，每个子句至多三个文字。子句采用集合表示，重复文字已合并；空子句不可满足，空 CNF 可满足。与恰三个不同文字版本可经新鲜变量填充多项式互约，但本目录不再把该变体误记为原书定义。</p>\n<p>来源核对：§2.3.1；印刷44–45页；PDF70–71页。已核对“至多”而非“恰好”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"c8f19b1793fdfb6a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sat","status":"resolved","id":"4041cfa2975b8dd1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-cnf","status